OL,3,AFour charged with murder after baby
OL,4,Astabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men and two women have been charged
OL,7,Fwith murder after a baby girl was found
OL,8,Fstabbed to death at house in Sheffield.
OL,10,FThe newborn was found at a house on
OL,11,FHolywell Heights in the Wincobank area
OL,12,Fon Sunday morning, after police were
OL,13,Fcalled to reports of concern for her
OL,14,Fsafety.
OL,16,FPolice said two men, aged 19 and 38,
OL,17,Fand two women, aged 20 and 37, had been
OL,18,Fcharged with murder, causing or
OL,19,Fallowing the death of a child and
OL,20,Fperverting the course of justice by
OL,21,Ftaking steps to conceal the killing of
OL,22,Fan infant.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
